{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Xi9qwmeOFs1794365371.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>前立法會議員黃錦輝，涉嫌酒後駕駛的案件再提堂，他承認一項不小心駕駛罪。</p><p></p><p>黃錦輝由代表律師謝偉俊陪同，抵達沙田裁判法院應訊。</p><p></p><p>案情指，他涉嫌今年6月29日晚，在中大校園內酒後駕駛，撞到兩輛車後不顧而去，其後被控酒後駕駛、危險駕駛、發生交通意外後無停車，及發生交通意外後沒有報案四項控罪。控方改控不小心駕駛罪，黃錦輝承認控罪。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T04:32:10.994153+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T04:45:50.264854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T04:25:36.675842+00:00","content_hash":"3bbbf485fd985688c5e256f5508e7465b1a151eb44c63591d98dd9e8d8049fa4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T04:32:10.994153+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}